@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

# ============================================================
# TOKEN: jalankan request login (nomor 1 / 3), copy isi
# "access_token" dari hasilnya, lalu tempel setelah tanda "=".
# Token berlaku 60 menit. Kalau "Token sudah kedaluwarsa",
# login ulang dan ganti tokennya.
# PENTING: sebelum commit, kembalikan ke tulisan contoh di bawah.
# ============================================================
@tokenMhs = TEMPEL_TOKEN_MAHASISWA_DI_SINI
@tokenAdmin = TEMPEL_TOKEN_ADMIN_DI_SINI


### 1. Login mahasiswa (BERHASIL -> 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"187221000001@student.siakad.ac.id","password":"187221000001"}

### 2. Profil mahasiswa yang login (-> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}

### 3. Login admin (BERHASIL -> 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@siakad.ac.id","password":"admin12345"}

### 4. Profil admin (-> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 5. Password salah (-> 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@siakad.ac.id","password":"salahsalah"}

### 6. Validasi gagal (-> 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"bukan-email","password":"123"}

### 7. /me tanpa token (-> 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 8. /me dengan token palsu (-> 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer tokenpalsu123


### ===================== COURSES =====================

### 9. Daftar semua mata kuliah (-> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}

### 10. Filter semester 5 + cari "basis" (-> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?semester=5&search=basis
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}

### 11. Hanya yang kuotanya belum penuh (-> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?available=true
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}

### 12. Query tidak valid (-> 422)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?semester=abc&available=ya
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}

### 13. Tanpa token (-> 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses


### ===================== STUDENTS (pakai tokenAdmin) =====================

### 14. Daftar mahasiswa (-> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 15. Pagination + sort IPK tertinggi (-> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students?page=2&per_page=5&sort=-ipk_terakhir
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 16. Filter prodi + angkatan + search (-> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students?prodi=Sistem%20Informasi&angkatan=2022&search=rina
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 17. Daftar mahasiswa sebagai mahasiswa (-> 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}

### 18. Tambah mahasiswa (-> 201, hanya berhasil sekali)
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nim":"187221000099","nama":"Zahra Amelia","email":"zahra@student.siakad.ac.id","prodi":"Sistem Informasi","angkatan":2024,"ipk_terakhir":3.2}

### 19. Tambah mahasiswa dengan NIM/email yang sama (-> 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nim":"187221000099","nama":"Zahra Lagi","email":"zahra@student.siakad.ac.id","prodi":"Sistem Informasi","angkatan":2024}

### 20. Tambah mahasiswa data tidak valid (-> 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nim":"123","email":"bukan-email","angkatan":2099,"ipk_terakhir":5}

### 21. Detail mahasiswa id 1 sebagai admin (-> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 22. Mahasiswa lihat data sendiri, Rina = id 1 (-> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}

### 23. Mahasiswa lihat data orang lain (-> 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}

### 24. Detail id tidak ada (-> 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 25. Update mahasiswa (-> 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nama":"Rina Putri","prodi":"Sistem Informasi","angkatan":2022,"ipk_terakhir":3.45}

### 26. Update mencoba ubah NIM (-> 422)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nim":"111111111111","nama":"Rina Putri","prodi":"Sistem Informasi","angkatan":2022}

### 27. Soft delete mahasiswa id 20 (-> 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/students/20
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 28. Hapus lagi id yang sama (-> 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/students/20
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}


### ===================== ENROLLMENTS / KRS (pakai tokenMhs) =====================

### 29. Ambil mata kuliah MK001 (-> 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"course_id":1,"tahun_akademik":"2026/2027-Ganjil"}

### 30. Ambil MK001 lagi di tahun yang sama (-> 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"course_id":1,"tahun_akademik":"2026/2027-Ganjil"}

### 31. Mata kuliah tidak ada (-> 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"course_id":999,"tahun_akademik":"2026/2027-Ganjil"}

### 32. Format tahun akademik salah (-> 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"course_id":2,"tahun_akademik":"2026-Ganjil"}

### 33. Admin mencoba ambil mata kuliah (-> 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"course_id":2,"tahun_akademik":"2026/2027-Ganjil"}

### 34. Cek KRS sendiri lewat detail mahasiswa (-> 200, lihat enrollment_id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}

### 35. Batalkan KRS -> GANTI angka 1 dengan "id" dari hasil nomor 29 (-> 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}

### 36. Batalkan KRS yang tidak ada (-> 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs}}